{"id":"nccc5c872ff","headline":"Saudi East-West oil pipeline is said to be flowing as normal","summary":"The Saudi East-West oil pipeline is said to be flowing as normal. This follows reports that the conduit was halted after a fresh strike on a pumping station along it.","why":"The East-West pipeline lets Saudi Arabia export crude from the Red Sea coast, bypassing the Gulf and the Strait of Hormuz. Disruptions to it can affect global oil supply.","category":"commodities","event_type":"energy-supply","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Riyadh","country":"Saudi Arabia","lat":24.71,"lon":46.68,"region":"me"},"entities":[{"name":"Saudi Aramco","ticker":"2222.SR","kind":"company","asset":{"id":"EQ:XSAU:2222","n":"Saudi Aramco","c":"equity","px":"2222.SR","la":24.71,"lo":47.34047636505156,"geo":"markets","site":"ARMCO","co":"CO:EQ:XSAU:2222","m":"ticker+name","rv":"registry-v1"}}],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Business Times","url":"https://www.businesstimes.com.sg/companies-markets/energy-commodities/saudi-east-west-oil-pipeline-said-be-flowing-normal"},"sources":[{"name":"The Business Times","url":"https://www.businesstimes.com.sg/companies-markets/energy-commodities/saudi-east-west-oil-pipeline-said-be-flowing-normal"}],"published_at":"2026-10-05T22:24:22Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"b13b7c60efca5769","impacts":[],"why_moved":"Reports that the pipeline had been halted after a strike on a pumping station raised supply concerns. The later report that flows are normal reduces that disruption risk.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-10-05T22:24:22Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-10-06T00:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"SA","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","fil